    <readme>NugetREADME.md</readme>
    <description>25 OPC UA analyzers (through UA0028, with gaps), code fixes, and a 1.5.378 API shim.</description>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2004-2025 OPC Foundation, Inc</copyright>
    <tags>OPCFoundation OPC UA analyzer codefix roslyn migration shim</tags>
